{"id": "49978", "title": "一色春", "author": "沉筱之", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 23, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/49/49978.htm", "intro": "一色春： 南霜，天水派大小姐。为人爽朗，性格淡定幽默。 江湖三位奇女子之一，人尽皆知的“南水桃花”，深谙闺房之术。 南霜十九岁出阁，嫁与万红阁二公子，却在第二日醒来，发现自己在江南少主穆衍风的床上。 一次噱头弄砸一门亲事，南霜嫁万红阁不成，却被江湖人见人怕的小魔头于桓之，糊弄着嫁去流云庄。 至此，南霜生涯突变，跌宕起落，天光春_色，一发不可收拾。  1月10日起，恢复日更 ——沉筱之 2011/01/08 此文独家发表于晋江原创网，谢绝转载。请转载的朋友一律撤文，删文。谢谢喜欢，见谅。     新坑求支持：【点图穿越】:", "base": "files/article/html/49/49978", "chapters": [{"title": "第01章", "file": "7136357.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02章", "file": "7136359.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03章", "file": "7136362.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第04章", "file": "7136364.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05章", "file": "7136367.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第06章", "file": "7136368.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07章", "file": "7136371.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第08章", "file": "7136372.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第09章", "file": "7136374.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10章", "file": "7136376.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11章", "file": "7136377.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12章", "file": "7136379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13章", "file": "7136381.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14章", "file": "7136383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15章", "file": "7136385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16章", "file": "7136389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17章", "file": "7136391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18章", "file": "7136393.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19章", "file": "7136397.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20章", "file": "7136399.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21章", "file": "7136400.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22章", "file": "7136404.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23章", "file": "7136406.html", "available": false}]}